graph TD
    A([📬 Start: Receive Petition
Notification via Email/Portal]) --> B[(ERP DB: Fetch Petition Details
Student, Course, Reason)]
    B --> C[Review Petition Summary:
Type, Reason, Student Context]
    C --> D{Petition
Type}
    D -- Prerequisite Override --> E[(ERP DB: Pull Student
Academic Transcript)]
    D -- Course Overload --> F[(ERP DB: Pull Student
Credit Load & GPA)]
    D -- Other --> G[Review Attached
Student Explanation]
    E --> H[Assess Student's
Preparation & Background]
    F --> I[Assess Workload Impact
on Student Performance]
    G --> J[Evaluate Justification
Against Department Policy]
    H --> K{Decision}
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K -- Approve --> L[Add Optional Comments
for Advisor/Registrar]
    L --> M[(ERP DB: Log Approval
& Forward to Academic Advisor)]
    M --> N[Notify Student:
Instructor Approved — Pending Advisor]
    K -- Reject --> O[Provide Rejection Reason
in Comments Field]
    O --> P[(ERP DB: Log Rejection
& Notify Student)]
    P --> Q[Notify Student:
Petition Rejected by Instructor]
    K -- Escalate --> R[(ERP DB: Escalate Petition
to Department Chair)]
    R --> S[Notify Student:
Petition Escalated for Review]
    N --> T([✅ End: Instructor Action Complete])
    Q --> T
    S --> T